/// M30 HISTORY-052 "T27 fresh: roots green".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t27_release_audit_test.go
/// static baseline for TestT27GeneratedArtifactsFresh
/// (L332-336) plus the probe args (L336), the dir
/// bind (L337), the run call (L338), the gen segs
/// (L342-343), the read call (L345), the marker
/// literal (L346) and the Fatal plus Error call
/// shapes (L339, L347).
/// Disposition: consolidate (this row ports the T27
/// generated-fresh offline pact to ordinary Can
/// functions beside the T26 sibling in HISTORY-047;
/// the old Go harness stays until the integrator
/// retires it after every linked row, variant,
/// environment and control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the static baseline as the
/// green root: the test symbol plus param, the two
/// comment lines, the root helper, the cataloguegen
/// path plus check flag, the two gen segs, the
/// marker literal, the read plus CombinedOutput
/// plus Contains call shapes, and the Fatal plus
/// Error call shapes.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): test-name
/// pins the TestT27GeneratedArtifactsFresh symbol
/// (L334); test-param pins t *testing.T (L334);
/// comment-fresh pins the fresh line (L332);
/// comment-truth pins the truth line (L333);
/// root-helper pins the repoRoot call (L335);
/// cataloguegen-path pins the probe path (L336);
/// check-flag pins --check (L336, L339);
/// gen-go-seg pins generated.go (L342); gen-ts-seg
/// pins catalogue.ts (L343); marker-lit pins the
/// DO NOT EDIT literal (L346); read-call pins the
/// readRepoFile call (L345); combined-call pins
/// cmd.CombinedOutput() (L338); contains-call pins
/// strings.Contains (L346); fatal-call pins t.Fatalf
/// (L339); error-call pins t.Errorf (L347).
/// Facet map (static baseline): test-name pins the
/// symbol (L334); test-param pins the param (L334);
/// comment-fresh pins the line (L332); comment-truth
/// pins the line (L333); root-helper pins the call
/// (L335); cataloguegen-path pins the path (L336);
/// check-flag pins the flag (L336, L339);
/// gen-go-seg pins the seg (L342); gen-ts-seg pins
/// the seg (L343); marker-lit pins the literal
/// (L346); read-call pins the call (L345);
/// combined-call pins the call (L338);
/// contains-call pins the call (L346); fatal-call
/// pins the call (L339); error-call pins the call
/// (L347).
/// The verdict pins live in
/// history-052-base-semantics.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-052-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; the single
/// passing path in Go order).
/// Environment: one gate (Bun/Go/Git for T01 smoke or
/// generator when applicable); binds at P23, requires
/// [] now (offline only).
/// Logical gates SUITE/DOC/FILES/PROC/BUILD/WORK bind
/// at P23; no live run now. Accept gate P23 is
/// unmet. Timeout 120000ms is the offline default
/// bound (no Go timeout in this row; binds at P23
/// like the M11 rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case history/t27-fresh-roots checks: test-name,
/// test-param, comment-fresh, comment-truth,
/// root-helper, cataloguegen-path, check-flag,
/// gen-go-seg, gen-ts-seg, marker-lit, read-call,
/// combined-call, contains-call, fatal-call,
/// error-call.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later
/// integrator decision.
